OL,3,A'Dad dragged me out of bed by my hair
OL,4,Ato work' ` rural abuse victims want
OL,5,Amore support
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This story contains content
OL,8,Fthat some readers might find
OL,9,Fdistressing
OL,11,FGrowing up on a farm, Tracy Lewis loved
OL,12,Fbeing around its animals but said the
OL,13,Fphysical and emotional abuse from her
OL,14,Ffarmer father was "torture".
OL,16,FWhen she was eight, she recalled her
OL,17,Fdad pulling her out of bed by her hair
OL,18,Fto go lambing as her battered mum told
OL,19,Fher "you have to get the lamb out or
OL,20,Fwe're both going to die".
