OL,3,A'Dad dragged me out of bed by my hair
OL,4,Ato work' ` rural abuse victims want
OL,5,Amore support
OL,6,
OL,7,FTracy, now 48 and a farmer herself, and
OL,8,Fother domestic abuse survivors are
OL,9,Fcalling on governments to better
OL,10,Fsupport victims in rural areas.
